# PBCOM-PUSH-HOST — the ONE host allowed to run the PB.com push (singleton gate 1).
#
# Copy to `PBCOM-PUSH-HOST` (no extension) and put the short hostname of the club
# Mac mini on a line by itself. An UNSET / missing fact fails CLOSED: nobody drives.
# This mirrors courtreserve-api's EVENTS-DRAIN-HOST / BILLING-HOST facts.
#
# ⚠️ Designating a host makes this an unattended fleet singleton. Per daemon
# convention, do NOT set it until the INFRA-INTAKE pass (see DESIGN.md) is done
# with Ron and the trace has filled the form seams.
#
# Example (uncomment + set the real hostname on the copy, not here):
# wmpcMacMini1
